   *    - shopping_mall_customer_id: filter by reviewer
   *    - shopping_mall_product_id: filter by product
   *    - created_at: date range filtering (from/to)
   *    - deleted_at: include/exclude soft-deleted reviews
   * 3. Full-text search on content field using ILIKE or full-text search index
   *
   * Pagination:
