   * - Default page size: 20 items
   * - Maximum page size: 100 items
   *
   * Sorting:
   * - Primary sort: created_at DESC (newest first)
   * - Secondary sort: id DESC for stable ordering
   *
   * Response transformation:
   * - Include customer display_name (or 'deleted user' if customer account deleted)
   * - Include product name for context
   * - Flag deleted reviews with is_deleted boolean
   *
   * Authorization:
   * - Administrator only (kind: admin)
   * - Regular and super administrators have access
